bstone","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2022-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mo visits an estranged family member to obtain a document for the Najjars' asylum case. When Sameer gets into trouble, the family unites to help.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yvxW71pZamL4es1bLx8C0SwNQxO.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL01vLSUyODIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Holy Matrimony","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2022-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Hamid's big day is off to a rocky start when his groomsmen end up on a dangerous mission. At the house, Maria has an uncomfortable exchange with Yusra.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5EgKQg076vrVn8CFxHo0P9R6wkX.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL01vLSUyODIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Testimony","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2022-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As their asylum hearing date approaches, Lizzie preps the Najjars and Yusra gets candid. Anxious and depleted, Mo struggles to cope with his new reality.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1qVwcI1ibLuZqSjUsq63HCzqU6F.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIyL01vLSUyODIwMjItJTI5Lw.1.8","title":"Vamos","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2022-08-24T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Yusra and Sameer unveil their business idea to Mo and invite him on board. Mo later cuts a deal with Buddy that leads him to uncharted territory.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/isyKjfzQbNOwR8qWzpqrmqsrq0b.jpg"}]}}